  "intermediateFailures": [
    "The first whole-repository run found the public ui/theme expected-export list had not included the two intentional neutral continuity functions. The list was updated; the Vue/business import prohibition remains intact. The focused check and final whole-repository retry pass; the initial log is retained as c00-continuation-test-initial.log.",
    "The second whole-repository run found two existing Classic navigation fixtures injected their scroll owner only after mounting, when the new semantic bridge had already read the DOM owner. The owner is now supplied before mount, preserving every scroll/focus assertion; all 35 Classic library regressions and the final whole-repository retry pass. The second log is retained as c00-continuation-test-second.log.",
    "The root return-metadata addition initially inferred only scrollTop; an explicit neutral state type fixed its typecheck. The first targeted typecheck log is retained.",
    "Agent focused iterations exposed delayed measurement landing, incomplete browser-like dataset/attribute test-host behavior, and cancellation edge cases; failure/retry logs remain under their recorded prefixes."
  ],
